@startuml
title Concurrent Booking Attempts for One Slot
actor "Student A" as A
actor "Student B" as B
participant "Booking API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
A -> API : Request slot S
B -> API : Request slot S
API -> DB : Transaction A: INSERT
API -> DB : Transaction B: INSERT
DB --> API : A commits
DB --> API : B rejected by unique constraint
API --> A : 201 Created
API --> B : 409 SLOT_ALREADY_BOOKED
note over DB
A partial unique index allows only one active
booking for each slot.
end note
@enduml